# Hard Brexit (Dhingra et al. 2017), reported only: crossing tau x 1.0831 both ways between GBR
# and each EU27 member, and each side's MFN tariff on the other: the EU common external tariff
# of the 2000 pack (EU27 on USA: group 0 0.0314, group 1 0.0214), which GBR applied in 2000.
# Rule: each side's tariff on the other becomes max(2000 tariff, CET), so a line adds only
# CET - 2000 tariff where that is positive. GBR has agreements at 0 with every member but CYP,
# HRV, MLT and ROU in the pack; it already applies the CET to those four, and they apply at
# least the CET to it (CYP 0.1173 / 0.0221, HRV 0.0398 / 0.0469, MLT 0.068 / 0.1031, ROU
# 0.0965 / 0.0664), so their pairs take the iceberg lines only.
ntb GBR AUT 1.0831
ntb AUT GBR 1.0831
tariff AUT GBR 0 0.0314
tariff AUT GBR 1 0.0214
tariff GBR AUT 0 0.0314
tariff GBR AUT 1 0.0214
